WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:32.800
The battle ritual is my final test to determine my destiny.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:41.470
My partner was willing to accept this duel, so I must fight with all my pride!

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:49.450
I summoned the three Gods: Obelisk the Tormentor, Slifer the Sky Dragon and The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:53.040
Partner, can you keep up when I duel at full strength?

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:59.010
Defeat the Three Gods!

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:09.190
My other self is serious.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.970
I activate the spell card, Pot of Greed!

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:22.560
I draw two cards from my deck and end my turn!

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:28.800
Big brother, this is incredible.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.790
He managed to summon all three Gods?

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:37.460
Unbelievable.  I never imagined I’d see this in my entire life.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.140
Sister…

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:43.420
The Pharaoh’s power is far greater than we imagined.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.140
So this is Atem’s true power.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:51.520
Yugi’s trap sealed up its effect and lowered its attack points.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:55.150
But Obelisk still has 2500 attack points.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:03:03.340
Slifer's effect deals 2000 damage to the opposing monster when it’s summoned.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:09.170
If Ra absorbs the Pharaoh's life points and the other monster's attack points...

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:14.460
...it'll have 14499 attack points.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:18.180
A single duelist has three Gods on his field.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:24.180
Atem used his duel tactics to navigate his Super Heavy Deck and summon them.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.600
This duel is one for the history books.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:32.220
But the victor is already decided.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.570
Wait, Kaiba!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.610
It's not decided yet!

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.920
That’s right!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.770
The duel isn't over!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:46.450
None of you have ever played a God, so you know nothing.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:47.860
Say what!

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.210
Then answer this, loser!

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:55.320
Do you know how to defeat the three Gods?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.000
W-Well...

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:02.220
You don’t.  Because it's impossible.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.800
No, there has to be a way!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:10.230
Marik!  You know Ra's weakness, don't you?

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.230
If it was Ra alone, he might have a chance.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:16.580
But with all three Gods...

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:20.060
This may be destiny's will.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:26.240
After 3,000 years, the Pharaoh has grown too strong to be stopped.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:31.120
If no one can equal him, this battle ritual can't be completed.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.680
Ishizu…

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.820
Is this duel really over?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.920
Atem won't return to the afterlife?

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.260
Let’s go, Mokuba.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:43.610
Big brother!

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:45.260
Kaiba!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:52.270
Atem, it's decided that your soul won't return to the afterlife.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:55.180
So I'll settle things with you someday.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:01.830
Can I actually defeat the three Gods?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.680
Wait, Kaiba!

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:12.140
Kaiba, I want you to watch to the end.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:13.550
Yugi…

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:18.600
Yugi, I don't have time to watch you lose.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:21.300
You have it all wrong.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:29.600
Kaiba and my other self's souls have an unbreakable bond.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:36.850
I want you to see my other self return to the afterlife.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:41.670
Yugi, are you serious?

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:48.800
Kaiba, what you said made me realize that I must defeat the three Gods.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.200
I will win this duel!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.910
What?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.920
Yugi...

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:00.720
That’s why I’m here!

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.660
That’s the spirit, partner.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:11.530
Ridiculous!  Yugi, you really think you can destroy the three Gods?

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.580
Fine, Yugi.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:21.860
If you’re so insistent, I’ll stay and watch your duel to the end!

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:25.150
Partner, it’s your turn.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.180
My turn!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.120
What’s wrong with Yugi?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.380
Yugi, do your bes-

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:44.930
He’s focusing on battle himself.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:50.870
Only someone who's battled a God knows how daunting and terrifying that is.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:52.390
You're right.

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:04.180
I can't put into words how terrifying that was.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:11.410
I’m here to win.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:16.860
I knew from the start that he would summon the three Gods.  However...

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:20.800
I’m so scared that I feel like running away.

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:25.060
I’ve worked hard to catch up to you.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:33.980
And I felt like I would catch up.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:41.000
But you're still so far away.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:51.540
Any duelist who can't trust his deck during crucial moments can never defeat me.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:08:03.810
If you’re a true duelist and a friend, you would've subconsciously thought of how to defeat me!

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:10.020
Yugi would've thought of how to defeat the other Yugi?

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:13.080
That's what a true duelist would do.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:19.350
When we built our decks, we both were determined to defeat the other.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:24.730
You're right.  I spent the whole time thinking about you.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.900
How you mustered the courage to face countless obstacles.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.490
Same goes for me, partner.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.840
I thought of you too.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:43.240
Your kindness is your strength - you would rather be hurt than hurt others.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.510
So both our decks have...

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:49.240
Your courage…

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:52.040
And your strength!

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.180
I see!

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:58.470
Even though we've separated, we built this deck together.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:04.980
This is the strongest deck I ever built because I want to send you home to the afterlife.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.260
Right.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:09.080
Thank you, my other self.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:11.100
I’m not afraid anymore.

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:14.860
This deck contains everything I’ve learned from you.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.920
No matter what happens, don't stop fighting.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:22.760
Always believe in your deck and your monsters.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:25.300
That's the courage and pride of a duelist.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.550
Here I go, my other self!

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.230
Bring it on, partner!

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.670
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.550
Yugi!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.070
Do your best, Yugi!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:39.770
Since it's my turn, Silent Swordsman gains a Level!

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:42.730
Silent Swordsman LV4!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:48.290
Silent Swordsman has 3000 attack points!

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:50.130
It can destroy Obelisk!

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:56.320
I tribute Alpha, Beta and Gamma the Magnet Warriors from my hand!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:01.580
I Special Summon Valkyrion the Magna Warrior in attack position!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:08.940
When you summon a monster, Slifer’s effect activates!

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:12.110
Go Slifer!  Lightning Bullet!

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:19.150
Hang in there, Valkyrion the Magna Warrior.

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:22.360
I activate a Quick-Play Spell from my hand!

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.810
Mirage Spell!

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:36.730
Mirage Spell activates when my monster is attacked.

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:41.620
It negates the effect, and I gain life points equal to its attack points!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.620
Nice!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.010
Well done, Yugi!

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:49.630
Yugi stopped Lightning Bullet!

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:54.720
He used Slifer’s effect to restore his life points.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:59.150
But those life points are nothing against a God!

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:02.160
I set two cards!

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:04.460
I end my turn!

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:25.360
Huh?  Yugi didn't attack?

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:27.350
He couldn’t even if he wanted to.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:30.720
A careless attack against a God will lead to self-destruction.

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:37.320
But I'm more bothered that Yugi left all his monsters in attack position.

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:41.760
He won't be able to to survive an attack from the three Gods.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.170
Let’s see your secret strategy, Yugi!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:50.200
Partner, are you trying to lure me in?

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:58.850
Silent Swordsman LV4 and Valkyrion the Magna Warrior are powerful monsters against a normal opponent.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:02.100
But they’re no match against the three Gods.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.170
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:08.820
I have four cards in my hand!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:12.710
So Slifer’s attack points rise to 4000!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.710
Here I go, Yugi!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:20.230
Slifer the Sky Dragon attacks Silent Swordsman!

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:22.390
I activate my trap card!

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:26.110
Traps don’t work against the Gods!

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:28.520
Go, Slifer!

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:35.070
God's hammer comes crashing down!

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:36.850
Thunder Force!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.370
What an impact!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.800
It's not over!  The other Gods will attack!

00:12:55.800 --> 00:13:00.690
The Winged Dragon of Ra attacks Valkyrion the Magna Warrior!

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.420
Valkyrion the Magna Warrior!

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:18.780
Yugi has no monsters left on his field.

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:22.200
But Obelisk still hasn’t attacked!

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:25.230
If Yugi takes that attack, he'll lose!

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.780
Yugi…

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.790
Big brother.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.790
This was the best he could do.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:36.940
Partner, this is my final attack!

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.430
Here I go!

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:43.260
Obelisk the Tormentor attacks you directly!

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:46.340
God Hand Crusher!

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:51.710
Yugi!

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:57.440
What?

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:07.280
Why are Valkyrion the Magna Warrior and Silent Swordsman there?

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.530
Can it be your trap?

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.080
Yes.  I activated this card.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:17.170
Mirage Ruler?

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:19.420
Yugi regained his life points!

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:28.070
Mirage Ruler activates when all my monsters are destroyed during your Battle Phase.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:34.850
My monsters and life points are restored to how they were before the Battle Phase.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.850
Then I pay 1000 life points.

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.390
Not bad, partner.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:46.090
I see.  He laid a trap on his own field this time.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:51.300
Obelisk’s attack points remain lowered to 2500.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:55.920
If it attacks either monster, it’ll destroy itself.

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:58.760
I end my turn.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.100
That was close.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:05.630
He managed to survive, Grandpa.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:10.210
That’s my Yugi!  But my ticker can’t take much more of this.

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:11.710
You said it.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:13.940
I wonder if you can survive to the end.

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:18.460
I’ll never get to see a duel like this again!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.880
I refuse to die before seeing how this ends.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.820
You’ve grown strong, Yugi.

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:28.740
Fight hard so you won't have any regrets.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:31.180
Thank goodness.

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:35.400
When did I start rooting for Yugi?

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:40.920
Big brother, Yugi avoided the three Gods' attacks!

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:44.420
But that's only delaying the inevitable.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:48.840
Yugi can't win unless he finds the Gods’ weaknesses.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.010
The Gods’ weakness?

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:54.120
Even the Gods have weaknesses.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.680
Or should I say, "had."

00:15:56.270 --> 00:16:05.940
The Gods' only weakness is that you need three tributes to summon them.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:12.630
But Atem has already cleared this hurdle to create this unbelievable situation.

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:14.950
That means...

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.550
The Gods have no weaknesses.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.010
What will you do, Yugi?

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:23.200
Even I couldn’t find the Gods' weakness.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:27.380
To defeat the Gods, find this weakness!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:31.310
Duel beyond my expectations, Yugi!

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:35.760
Yugi will challenge the Pharaoh on his next turn.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.560
Sister, you know because-

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.930
No, I can't see the future.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.360
It’s just a feeling.

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:47.380
You believe Yugi can defeat the Gods?

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:56.260
I don’t know.  But watching Yugi reminds me of the nameless Pharaoh’s soul.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:17:00.750
His strength surpassed our imaginations.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:07.000
But the vessel must be just as strong to contain such a powerful soul.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:12.220
He may have started as a small vessel, but by traveling together with the Pharaoh...

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:17.200
...he has grown into a large vessel.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.480
He has?

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:24.670
Yes.  A person's vessel grows by overcoming challenges.

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:29.800
They're sometimes referred to as "opportunities," other times as "miracles."

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:33.740
You're saying Yugi will perform a miracle?

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:39.040
I managed to avoid the Gods' attacks.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:45.850
But if the Gods attack me on my other self's next turn, I can't win.

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:52.480
That card has been set before I played Turn Jump.

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:57.620
But my other self has shown no signs of wanting to activate it.

00:17:57.620 --> 00:18:00.700
There can only be one reason why.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:05.050
Because I haven’t attacked even once since using Turn Jump.

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:11.490
If I’m reading this correctly, that card must be Mirror Force.

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:18.440
My odds are slim, but I have a combo in my deck that can defeat the Gods.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:24.700
I have 0 cards in my hand, so my fate depends on my next draw.

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:28.520
No, not just my fate.  But my other self's as well!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:31.090
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:33.530
Here I go, my other self!

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.080
Bring it on, partner!

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:38.510
Are you planning to attack, Yugi?

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:44.100
Since it's my turn, Silent Swordsman rises to Level 5!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:49.920
I activate Valkyrion the Magna Warrior’s effect!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:55.480
When Alpha, Beta and Gamma the Magnet Warriors are in my graveyard...

00:18:55.480 --> 00:19:02.420
...I can tribute Valkyrion the Magna Warrior to Special Summon them!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.840
Have you gone mad, Yugi?

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:11.800
Splitting your strong monster into weaker ones is self-destruction against the Gods!

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:28.300
Since you summoned monsters to your field, Slifer’s effect activates!

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:30.460
What are you doing, Yugi?

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:34.900
Any monster with 2000 or lower attack points will be destroyed!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.840
Go, Slifer!

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.730
Lightning Bullet!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.850
I was waiting for this moment!

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:44.730
The trap card, Magnet Force!

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:49.240
What?

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:57.420
Magnet Force activates when your effect is used on my Rock or Machine-Type monsters.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:02.100
I can switch the effect's target to your monsters!

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:05.530
A trap on his own monsters?

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:09.420
Lightning Bullet will strke the Gods!

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:21.930
The Gods’ attack points have dropped!

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:25.990
Yugi’s monsters can now destroy the Gods!

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:31.780
Silent Swordsman LV5 attacks Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:36.620
Not good enough, partner!

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:38.170
I activate my trap!

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:41.500
Mirror Force!

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:42.800
What?

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:02.240
Yugi's monsters...

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.240
...were all destroyed.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.530
Yugi!

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.960
Your intuition was off.

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:14.960
Atem’s game tactics were better than his.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.570
Yugi, you’ve wasted my time!

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:23.730
Too bad, partner.  You couldn't figure out my set card.

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:27.180
No, I knew what your set card was.

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:33.960
By activating Mirror Force, you completed my combo to defeat the Gods!

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:38.780
The three Gods will now vanish!

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:39.890
What?

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:13.970
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:29.690
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:35.530
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.850 --> 00:22:44.100
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:49.740
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:58.210
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.570 --> 00:23:04.020
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.810 --> 00:23:12.160
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.350 --> 00:23:15.420
In a duel

